        "cooked": "<p>hii,</p><aside class=\"onebox googledocs\" data-onebox-src=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1p4vkujo7UF5L30owLpcwUnMXcWq3q7xJ/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=112377322796884694021&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1p4vkujo7UF5L30owLpcwUnMXcWq3q7xJ/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=112377322796884694021&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">docs.google.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1p4vkujo7UF5L30owLpcwUnMXcWq3q7xJ/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=112377322796884694021&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><span class=\"googledocs-onebox-logo g-docs-logo\"></span></a>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1p4vkujo7UF5L30owLpcwUnMXcWq3q7xJ/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=112377322796884694021&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">File Related commands.docx</a></h3>\n\n<p>Text Processing Commands wc command : it counts the number of lines, words and characters in the specified file or files. It comes with the options –l, -w, -c which allows the user to obtain the number of lines, words or characters individually or in...</p>\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
